$ gcc -g statements.c -o statements

	-g 	turns on debug info

:packadd
:Termdebug statements 

To set the same file and line breakpoint in LLDB you 
	can enter either of:

	(lldb) breakpoint set --file foo.c --line 12
	(lldb) breakpoint set -f foo.c -l 12

To set a breakpoint on a function named foo in LLDB you 
	can enter either of:

	(lldb) breakpoint set --name foo
	(lldb) breakpoint set -n foo
